36
00:02:15,002 --> 00:02:16,136
What's going on?

37
00:02:16,136 --> 00:02:18,138
Is the power out?

38
00:02:24,878 --> 00:02:26,346
Sorry, the power's out

39
00:02:26,346 --> 00:02:29,216
What happened to my hair?

40
00:02:34,021 --> 00:02:35,222
Wow!

41
00:02:35,222 --> 00:02:37,624
Looks like the whole place has lost power

42
00:02:37,624 --> 00:02:39,092
That's right

43
00:02:39,092 --> 00:02:40,961
Oh, no!

44
00:02:48,969 --> 00:02:49,970
That's great!

45
00:02:49,970 --> 00:02:51,438
Good thing it hasn't melted yet

46
00:02:51,438 --> 00:02:54,908
Wow, an ice cream cake!

47
00:02:54,908 --> 00:02:55,842
That's right

48
00:02:55,842 --> 00:02:58,311
It's a birthday cake for my daughter

49
00:02:58,311 --> 00:03:01,048
The baby's due any minute.

50
00:03:02,983 --> 00:03:05,385
Can I have a bite?

51
00:03:05,385 --> 00:03:06,319
No!

52
00:03:09,523 --> 00:03:11,058
