will melt!

55
00:03:22,469 --> 00:03:24,204
What should I do? The power is out again

56
00:03:24,204 --> 00:03:26,473
It's so hot! I'm so nervous! What do I do?

57
00:03:26,473 --> 00:03:27,274
You're so noisy!

58
00:03:30,210 --> 00:03:31,812
It's so hot!

59
00:03:31,812 --> 00:03:33,080
