63
00:03:36,016 --> 00:03:37,951
Well... um...

64
00:03:37,951 --> 00:03:38,952
The power is out

65
00:03:38,952 --> 00:03:40,087
The power's out?

66
00:03:40,087 --> 00:03:43,156
Oh, right, right! The power's out...

67
00:03:43,156 --> 00:03:44,291
