69
00:03:46,493 --> 00:03:49,229
Hmph! What's there to fear about a power
outage?

70
00:03:49,229 --> 00:03:50,363
Watch this!

71
00:03:58,905 --> 00:04:01,041
What's that?

72
00:04:02,309 --> 00:04:04,377
It's a generator

73
00:04:05,312 --> 00:04:07,047
As long as the wind turns the blades,

74
00:04:07,047 --> 00:04:08,448
