75
00:04:08,448 --> 00:04:09,449
Oh!

76
00:04:10,650 --> 00:04:11,585
But...

77
00:04:15,255 --> 00:04:17,724
There's not even a breeze right now

78
00:04:19,526 --> 00:04:20,594
It's okay

79
00:04:20,594 --> 00:04:22,796
I have another way to generate electricity

80
00:04:41,014 --> 00:04:42,149
That's great!

81
00:04:42,949 --> 00:04:44,084
That's great!

82
00:04:44,951 --> 00:04:46,353
Huh?

83
00:04:50,824 --> 00:04:53,093
That's a lot of smoke!

84
00:05:02,702 --> 00:05:03,637
Looks like...

85
00:05:03,637 --> 00:05:06,306
