86
00:05:19,319 --> 00:05:21,188
That's amazing!

87
00:05:21,188 --> 00:05:25,258
Of course!

88
00:05:31,998 --> 00:05:32,933
Manager!

89
00:05:32,933 --> 00:05:34,801
We don't have enough power again!

90
00:05:39,139 --> 00:05:40,006
Hang in there, Manager!

91
00:05:40,006 --> 00:05:41,474
I'll help too!

92
00:06:29,322 --> 00:06:30,590
All you have to do is slow down,

93
00:06:30,590 --> 00:06:32,058
