too

98
00:06:44,404 --> 00:06:45,939
Manager!

99
00:06:49,676 --> 00:06:52,078
But there are only three of us

100
00:06:52,078 --> 00:06:53,146
If we keep running,

101
00:06:53,146 --> 00:06:55,682
