105
00:07:04,958 --> 00:07:07,694
Huh? How do we do it?

106
00:07:07,694 --> 00:07:11,498
Of course, we dance along with the
breakfast truck

107
00:07:29,449 --> 00:07:31,251
It's Brain Workout Time!

108
00:07:31,251 --> 00:07:34,988
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

109
00:07:34,988 --> 00:07:36,790
Clap! Clap!

110
00:07:36,790 --> 00:07:38,658
Jump up!

111
00:07:38,658 --> 00:07:42,128
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

112
00:07:42,128 --> 00:07:44,064
Clap! Clap!

113
00:07:44,064 --> 00:07:44,731
Jump up!

114
00:07:44,731 --> 00:07:45,999
Jump up!

115
00:07:45,999 --> 00:07:49,803
Make a sun with your hands and say good
morning

116
00:07:49,803 --> 00:07:51,871
Clap! Clap!

117
00:07:51,871 --> 00:07:55,342
Bi Ru Akokay

118
00:07:56,743 --> 00:07:58,812
I've got a good idea

119
00:07:58,878 --> 00:08:00,413
Just wait and watch

120
00:08:06,419 --> 00:08:08,221
Come one, come all!

121
00:08:08,221 --> 00:08:09,889
Power-outage special!

122
00:08:09,889 --> 00:08:12,092
Run on the treadmill for ten minutes,

123
00:08:12,092 --> 00:08:15,562
