for free!

124
00:08:15,562 --> 00:08:16,563
Free?

125
00:08:16,563 --> 00:08:17,764
Really?

126
00:08:17,764 --> 00:08:21,301
I want some! I want some too!

127
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:33,913
That's a great idea, Beelu

128
00:08:33,913 --> 00:08:36,316
Yes, the customers are coming back

129
00:08:36,316 --> 00:08:38,985
I can use this chance to promote our
products too

130
00:08:38,985 --> 00:08:39,652
Miss!

131
00:08:39,652 --> 00:08:42,522
Would you like to try our tea eggs?

132
00:08:43,323 --> 00:08:44,190
Huh?

133
00:08:48,728 --> 00:08:50,330
Daddy?

134
00:08:51,398 --> 00:08:55,335
Sweetheart, you're finally here!

135
00:08:55,335 --> 00:08:57,670
Here, happy birthday!

136
00:08:57,670 --> 00:08:59,539
Wow!

137
00:09:00,740 --> 00:09:02,342
Manager! Beelu!

138
00:09:02,342 --> 00:09:04,077
Would you like to have some cake with us?

139
00:09:04,544 --> 00:09:05,211
Sure!

140
00:09:11,017 --> 00:09:13,486
That was fun!

141
00:09:21,027 --> 00:09:22,829
Let's find breakfast!

142
00:09:22,829 --> 00:09:24,831
Here are the answers!

143
00:09:24,831 --> 00:09:27,300
Today's breakfast stickers are in these
places

144
00:09:35,775 --> 00:09:38,178
Yeah, I knew it!

145
00:09:39,779 --> 00:09:42,782
How do you make delicious tea eggs?

146
00:09:42,782 --> 00:09:46,119
First, wash the eggs well

147
00:09:46,119 --> 00:09:47,854
Put them into the machine

148
00:09:47,854 --> 00:09:51,591
Steam them

149
00:09:51,591 --> 00:09:54,127
Rinse them with cold water

150
00:09:54,127 --> 00:09:59,332
Crack the shells a little

151
00:09:59,332 --> 00:10:06,339
Add a braising spice sachet, a tea bag, soy sauce, and water

152
00:10:06,339 --> 00:10:10,276
Put them in an electric cooker to simmer

153
00:10:10,276 --> 00:10:11,478
Wait until they're ready

154
00:10:11,478 --> 00:10:15,815
And a pot of delicious tea eggs is done!

155
00:10:15,815 --> 00:10:19,018
Wow, they look delicious!

156
00:10:26,025 --> 00:10:27,227
All right, all right!

157
00:10:27,227 --> 00:10:29,028
