158
00:10:29,028 --> 00:10:32,165
Please bring your items here to check out

159
00:10:40,573 --> 00:10:41,508
That's strange

160
00:10:41,508 --> 00:10:44,711
So many people come to the convenience
store to shop

161
00:10:44,711 --> 00:10:46,913
But whenever I visit a convenience store,

162
00:10:46,913 --> 00:10:50,783
I see so many things on the shelves

163
00:10:50,783 --> 00:10:53,186
Does that mean the things in convenience
stores

164
00:10:53,186 --> 00:10:55,588
never sell out?

165
00:10:55,588 --> 00:10:58,525
That's because...

166
00:10:58,525 --> 00:10:59,993
when you're not at the store,

167
00:10:59,993 --> 00:11:02,195
while everyone is asleep,

168
00:11:02,195 --> 00:11:03,930
big trucks come

169
00:11:03,930 --> 00:11:05,598
and deliver all kinds of products

170
00:11:05,598 --> 00:11:08,268
to every convenience store

171
00:11:08,268 --> 00:11:12,138
The staff then put the products on the
shelves one by one

172
00:11:12,138 --> 00:11:14,073
That way, when customers come in,

173
00:11:14,073 --> 00:11:16,676
they have plenty to choose from

174
00:11:16,676 --> 00:11:19,946
Oh, so while we're sleeping,

175
00:11:19,946 --> 00:11:21,614
there are people working

176
00:11:21,614 --> 00:11:23,016
That's right

177
00:11:23,016 --> 00:11:25,151
Thanks to the people who work at night,

178
00:11:25,151 --> 00:11:28,354
we can enjoy convenient lives during the
day

179
00:11:28,354 --> 00:11:31,558
Also, each store's cash register tells the
manager

180
00:11:31,558 --> 00:11:34,427
which products are popular at that store

181
00:11:34,427 --> 00:11:36,829
So when the big truck comes next time,

182
00:11:36,829 --> 00:11:38,698
they'll ask for more of those products

183
00:11:38,698 --> 00:11:40,166
so the popular items

184
00:11:40,166 --> 00:11:41,768
won't sell out so quickly

185
00:11:43,369 --> 00:11:45,772
Oh, I see!

186
00:11:45,772 --> 00:11:46,506
Hey!

187
00:11:46,506 --> 00:11:47,774
Can't you see how many customers there
are?

188
00:11:47,774 --> 00:11:48,841
Come help me!

189
00:11:48,841 --> 00:11:50,310
Sorry, I'm coming!
